WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.384 --> 00:00:03.284
Unit one. Introducing Myself!

2
00:00:04.299 --> 00:00:09.923
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English!

3
00:00:09.973 --> 00:00:13.175
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.225 --> 00:00:17.021
Today we learn: Introducing Myself. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.308 --> 00:00:21.508
Name. Say it with me. Name!

6
00:00:25.018 --> 00:00:28.552
Age. Say it with me. Age!

7
00:00:32.055 --> 00:00:36.322
Nationality. Say it with me. Nationality!

8
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.733
Introduce. Say it with me. Introduce!

9
00:00:47.207 --> 00:00:50.757
Classmate. Say it with me. Classmate!

10
00:00:54.308 --> 00:00:57.758
Hobby. Say it with me. Hobby!

11
00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:04.596
Favorite. Say it with me. Favorite!

12
00:01:08.121 --> 00:01:11.321
Friendly. Say it with me. Friendly!

13
00:01:14.788 --> 00:01:18.255
Shy. Say it with me. Shy!

14
00:01:21.806 --> 00:01:25.922
Outgoing. Say it with me. Outgoing!

15
00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:32.656
Greet. Say it with me. Greet!

16
00:01:36.123 --> 00:01:40.256
Nice to meet you. Say it with me. Nice to meet you!

17
00:01:43.717 --> 00:01:53.059
Grammar time! Simple present: be + adjective. Listen. I am friendly. She is shy.

18
00:01:53.109 --> 00:01:58.293
Your turn. Say it with me. I am friendly. She is shy.

19
00:02:03.381 --> 00:02:11.529
Hi, my name is Sophea and I am thirteen years old. I am friendly and outgoing, and my favorite hobby is drawing.

20
00:02:11.579 --> 00:02:13.136
I like this story!

21
00:02:14.105 --> 00:02:19.214
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:19.264 --> 00:02:20.459
Nationality!

23
00:02:21.677 --> 00:02:26.826
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:26.876 --> 00:02:28.026
Favorite!

25
00:02:28.872 --> 00:02:37.092
Think and answer. How would you introduce yourself to a new classmate?

26
00:02:37.142 --> 00:02:38.292
Great answer!

27
00:02:39.481 --> 00:02:43.975
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:02:44.025 --> 00:02:45.626
Bye-bye, friends!

